  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peacebuilding and Reconciliation through Artistic Citizenship for Young Artists in Mali phase II (2026-2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Primary objective is peacebuilding and reconciliation by utilising music, art performance, and education to bridge gaps between different ethnic groups in Mali, with a particular focus on the younger generation. 
Secondly, the project will strengthen the mutual understanding of cultures and values by active people-to-people engagement, exchange, and cultural cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
